{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "财报收集API服务",
    "description": "\n中国A股、港股财报PDF收集与提取API\n\n## 功能\n\n* **搜索**: 搜索A股和港股上市公司财报\n* **下载**: 下载单个或批量财报PDF\n* **查询**: 查询已下载PDF信息和统计\n* **提取**: 提取PDF中的财务数据、表格和文本\n* **缓存**: 管理提取结果缓存\n\n## 数据源\n\n* A股: 巨潮资讯网 (cninfo.com.cn)\n* 港股: 港交所披露易 (hkexnews.hk)\n        ",
    "version": "1.1.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/reports/cn/search": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "搜索"
        ],
        "summary": "Search Cn Reports",
        "description": "搜索中国A股上市公司财报\n\n- **stock_code**: 6位数字股票代码 (如: 000001, 600519)\n- **report_type**: 报告类型\n- **max_count**: 最大返回数量 (1-50)\n\n数据源: 巨潮资讯网",
        "operationId": "search_cn_reports_api_v1_reports_cn_search_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "stock_code",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[0-9]{6}$",
              "description": "6位股票代码",
              "title": "Stock Code"
            },
            "description": "6位股票代码"
          },
          {
            "name": "report_type",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "报告类型: annual(年报), semi_annual(半年报), quarterly(季报), all(全部)",
              "default": "annual",
              "title": "Report Type"
            },
            "description": "报告类型: annual(年报), semi_annual(半年报), quarterly(季报), all(全部)"
          },
          {
            "name": "max_count",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "maximum": 50,
              "minimum": 1,
              "description": "最大返回数量",
              "default": 10,
              "title": "Max Count"
            },
            "description": "最大返回数量"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/APIResponse_Dict_str__Any__"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
