    "/api/v1/extract/content": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "提取"
        ],
        "summary": "Extract Pdf Content",
        "description": "提取PDF中的结构化财务数据\n\n提供 pdf_path 或 pdf_id 之一:\n- **pdf_path**: PDF文件绝对路径\n- **pdf_id**: 从列表API获取的PDF记录ID\n- **force_refresh**: 是否强制重新提取(忽略缓存)\n\n默认返回 V2 结构:\n- document: 文档层元数据\n- periods: 标准化期间定义（full_year / ytd / single_quarter / point_in_time）\n- facts: 指标值（含 period_id、置信度、evidence_ids）\n- evidence: 证据链（页码、表格、行列定位）\n- quality: 结构化质量问题\n\n版本协商优先级:\n1. query 参数 schema=v1|v2\n2. Header: X-Schema-Version\n3. Header: Accept vendor MIME",
        "operationId": "extract_pdf_content_api_v1_extract_content_post",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "schema",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^(v1|v2)$"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "description": "响应结构版本（query 兼容入口）",
              "title": "Schema"
            },
            "description": "响应结构版本（query 兼容入口）"
          },
          {
            "name": "X-Schema-Version",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "description": "响应结构版本（header，优先级低于 query）",
              "title": "X-Schema-Version"
            },
            "description": "响应结构版本（header，优先级低于 query）"
          },
          {
            "name": "Accept",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "description": "支持 vendor MIME 版本协商，例如 application/vnd.financial-reports.v2+json",
              "title": "Accept"
            },
            "description": "支持 vendor MIME 版本协商，例如 application/vnd.financial-reports.v2+json"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Body_extract_pdf_content_api_v1_extract_content_post"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/APIResponse_Dict_str__Any__"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
